{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2030","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2030"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Public result of the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"rerank()"},{"type":"text","value":" activity, generic over the caller's document\nelement type so "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"document"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"rerankedDocuments"},{"type":"text","value":" carry the original values\n(strings or objects), not their serialized form."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdocument","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TDocument"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TDocument"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Properties"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"id","children":[{"type":"text","value":"id"}]},{"type":"code","value":"id: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2031","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2031"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"model","children":[{"type":"text","value":"model"}]},{"type":"code","value":"model: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2032","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2032"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"ranking","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ranking"}]},{"type":"code","value":"ranking: object[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2034","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2034"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Scored results, highest relevance first."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"document","children":[{"type":"text","value":"document"}]},{"type":"code","value":"document: TDocument;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"index","children":[{"type":"text","value":"index"}]},{"type":"code","value":"index: number;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"score","children":[{"type":"text","value":"score"}]},{"type":"code","value":"score: number;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"rerankeddocuments","children":[{"type":"text","value":"rerankedDocuments"}]},{"type":"code","value":"rerankedDocuments: TDocument[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2036","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2036"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The documents reordered by relevance — "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ranking.map(r => r.document)"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"usage","children":[{"type":"text","value":"usage"}]},{"type":"code","value":"usage: TokenUsage;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2044","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2044"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Usage for the request. Rerank typically bills in provider-defined \"search\nunits\" ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"usage.billed = { quantity, unit: 'units' }"},{"type":"text","value":") rather than tokens.\nSome providers (e.g. OpenRouter) may also report "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"totalTokens"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"cost"},{"type":"text","value":".\nCohere reports only search units and leaves the token counts at 0.\nThe deprecated "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unitsBilled"},{"type":"text","value":" field is still populated for compatibility."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tdocument","text":"TDocument","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"id","text":"id","level":3},{"id":"model","text":"model","level":3},{"id":"ranking","text":"ranking","level":3},{"id":"document","text":"document","level":4},{"id":"index","text":"index","level":4},{"id":"score","text":"score","level":4},{"id":"rerankeddocuments","text":"rerankedDocuments","level":3},{"id":"usage","text":"usage","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2030](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2030)\n\nPublic result of the `rerank()` activity, generic over the caller's document\nelement type so `document` / `rerankedDocuments` carry the original values\n(strings or objects), not their serialized form.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TDocument\n\n`TDocument` = `string`\n\n## Properties\n\n### id\n\n```ts\nid: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2031](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2031)\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nmodel: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2032](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2032)\n\n***\n\n### ranking\n\n```ts\nranking: object[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2034](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2034)\n\nScored results, highest relevance first.\n\n#### document\n\n```ts\ndocument: TDocument;\n```\n\n#### index\n\n```ts\nindex: number;\n```\n\n#### score\n\n```ts\nscore: number;\n```\n\n***\n\n### rerankedDocuments\n\n```ts\nrerankedDocuments: TDocument[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2036](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2036)\n\nThe documents reordered by relevance — `ranking.map(r => r.document)`.\n\n***\n\n### usage\n\n```ts\nusage: TokenUsage;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2044](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2044)\n\nUsage for the request. Rerank typically bills in provider-defined \"search\nunits\" (`usage.billed = { quantity, unit: 'units' }`) rather than tokens.\nSome providers (e.g. OpenRouter) may also report `totalTokens` and `cost`.\nCohere reports only search units and leaves the token counts at 0.\nThe deprecated `unitsBilled` field is still populated for compatibility.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: RerankResult\ntitle: RerankResult\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2030](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2030)\n\nPublic result of the `rerank()` activity, generic over the caller's document\nelement type so `document` / `rerankedDocuments` carry the original values\n(strings or objects), not their serialized form.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TDocument\n\n`TDocument` = `string`\n\n## Properties\n\n### id\n\n```ts\nid: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2031](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2031)\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nmodel: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2032](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2032)\n\n***\n\n### ranking\n\n```ts\nranking: object[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2034](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2034)\n\nScored results, highest relevance first.\n\n#### document\n\n```ts\ndocument: TDocument;\n```\n\n#### index\n\n```ts\nindex: number;\n```\n\n#### score\n\n```ts\nscore: number;\n```\n\n***\n\n### rerankedDocuments\n\n```ts\nrerankedDocuments: TDocument[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2036](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2036)\n\nThe documents reordered by relevance — `ranking.map(r => r.document)`.\n\n***\n\n### usage\n\n```ts\nusage: TokenUsage;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2044](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2044)\n\nUsage for the request. Rerank typically bills in provider-defined \"search\nunits\" (`usage.billed = { quantity, unit: 'units' }`) rather than tokens.\nSome providers (e.g. OpenRouter) may also report `totalTokens` and `cost`.\nCohere reports only search units and leaves the token counts at 0.\nThe deprecated `unitsBilled` field is still populated for compatibility.\n"}
